A landscape video made fullscreen on an OHOS phone turns to landscape.

Attach chrome::ohos::WatchFullscreenVideoOrientation to every tab
(screen_orientation_delegate_ohos.cc, in the overlay). Android does this in
Blink from video_fullscreen_orientation_lock_enabled, a WebPreferences
field that exists only on Android.

Generated against Chromium 154.0.8037.51 with chromium-154-harmonyos.patch
applied. Apply with:
  git apply ohos-fullscreen-video-orientation.patch

